values ('branch-weather', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Branch Weather', 'Your git status as a tiny forecast in the status line: sunny, cloudy or stormy.', 'Summarizes uncommitted changes, ahead/behind counts and merge conflicts as a one glance weather report. Silly, and weirdly effective.', 'Build me a Claude Code mod called branch-weather.

