values ('test-runner-pane', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Test Runner Pane', 'Re-runs the tests touched by Claude''s edits and shows pass/fail in a pane.', 'Detects your test runner, finds tests related to the files Claude changed and runs only those after each turn. Red rows are clickable to send the failure back to Claude.', 'Build me a Claude Code mod called test-runner-pane.

What it does: after each turn with file edits, run the tests related to the changed files and show results.
