values ('prompt-time-machine', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Prompt Time Machine', 'Search every prompt you sent this week and resend one with a keystroke.', 'Keeps a local history of your prompts across sessions. /history opens a searchable pane; pick one to drop it back in the prompt box.', 'Build me a Claude Code mod called prompt-time-machine.

What it does: save every prompt I submit with a timestamp and project path, and let me search and reuse them.
Where it shows: a pane opened by /history with a search field and a result list.
